WEBVTT

00:00:02.810 --> 00:00:05.810
It was just a small wish.

00:00:06.810 --> 00:00:08.610
For quiet, peaceful days.

00:00:09.320 --> 00:00:14.410
I was waiting to reunite with the
precious friend I'd been separated from.

00:00:15.110 --> 00:00:18.370
But instead, I was suddenly attacked.

00:00:20.040 --> 00:00:23.710
Encounters, battles, and
vast amounts of power...

00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:27.500
Fate has once again been
silently set in motion.

00:00:29.300 --> 00:00:33.470
Despite this maelstrom, I'll continue to
believe in the bonds that connect our hearts.

00:00:34.930 --> 00:00:39.930
Mahou Shoujo Lyrical
Nanoha A's will now begin.

00:02:35.460 --> 00:02:38.170
I see. So that's how it was!

00:02:38.170 --> 00:02:41.510
Yeah! And...

00:02:41.510 --> 00:02:42.510
Yeah?

00:02:42.510 --> 00:02:43.050
Yup.

00:02:46.060 --> 00:02:50.020
But yeah, I'm really looking
forward to seeing Fate.

00:02:50.600 --> 00:02:52.110
Yeah, definitely.

00:02:52.110 --> 00:02:52.770
And,

00:02:52.770 --> 00:02:55.780
if <i>we're</i> this excited
to see her come back...

00:02:56.480 --> 00:03:00.360
Nanoha-chan must be even more excited,

00:03:00.360 --> 00:03:02.990
since she has so many
memories together with her.

00:03:02.990 --> 00:03:04.410
You're right.

00:03:04.410 --> 00:03:10.160
After she heard that Fate was coming
back, Nanoha looked so happy.

00:03:10.160 --> 00:03:10.710
Yeah!

00:03:12.630 --> 00:03:17.170
You think we should start planning a
special welcome-back party for her?

00:03:18.170 --> 00:03:18.970
That'd be great!

00:03:18.970 --> 00:03:21.380
Yeah! Let's throw her a big party.

00:03:21.380 --> 00:03:23.220
Whose house should we have it at?

00:03:23.220 --> 00:03:26.430
How about at Midoriya?

00:03:39.490 --> 00:03:42.280
The Storm of Battle, Once Again.

00:03:49.000 --> 00:03:52.420
Attacking a civilian with magic...

00:03:52.420 --> 00:03:54.080
This crime can't be considered
a mere misdemeanor.

00:03:54.540 --> 00:03:56.960
Who the hell are you supposed to be?

00:03:56.960 --> 00:03:58.670
Some mage from the Administrative Bureau?

00:03:59.760 --> 00:04:02.680
Time-Space Administrative Bureau
provisional mage.

00:04:03.050 --> 00:04:05.010
Fate Testarossa.

00:04:06.850 --> 00:04:10.890
If you don't resist, you will be granted
the chance to plead in your own defense.

00:04:10.890 --> 00:04:13.230
If you consent to these conditions,
drop your weapon.

00:04:13.230 --> 00:04:14.770
Who would do something like that!?

00:04:16.980 --> 00:04:20.070
Yuuno, I'll leave Nanoha to you!

00:04:20.070 --> 00:04:20.780
Yeah!

00:04:24.570 --> 00:04:25.530
Yuuno-kun...

00:04:25.990 --> 00:04:26.780
Yeah.

00:04:42.670 --> 00:04:47.720
Fate's trial just ended, so everyone
was trying to get in touch with you.

00:04:47.720 --> 00:04:50.680
But the signal wouldn't connect
to you for some reason,

00:04:50.680 --> 00:04:52.810
and once we checked
into it at the Bureau...

00:04:52.810 --> 00:04:54.810
we saw that a wide-area
barrier had been set up.

00:04:55.310 --> 00:04:58.060
That's why we rushed here
to see what happened.

00:04:58.060 --> 00:04:59.320
I see.

00:04:59.820 --> 00:05:03.150
I'm sorry... and thank you...

00:05:03.150 --> 00:05:06.950
Who was that?
Why was she after you?

00:05:06.950 --> 00:05:10.700
I don't know...
She came at me out of nowhere...

00:05:12.250 --> 00:05:17.500
Well, everything's fine now.
Fate's here, and so is Arf.

00:05:18.630 --> 00:05:20.340
Arf-san is here, too?

00:05:24.590 --> 00:05:25.840
Bardiche.

00:05:26.680 --> 00:05:28.260
Arc Saber.

00:05:32.560 --> 00:05:34.140
Graf Eisen!

00:05:36.100 --> 00:05:37.690
Schwalbefliegen!

00:05:40.770 --> 00:05:41.730
Barrier!

00:05:43.070 --> 00:05:45.070
Panzerhindernis.

00:06:02.840 --> 00:06:04.670
Barrier...

00:06:07.300 --> 00:06:09.300
Break!

00:06:16.020 --> 00:06:16.480
You...!

00:06:25.190 --> 00:06:26.150
Pferde.

00:06:44.630 --> 00:06:45.920
<i>Damn it...</i>

00:06:46.800 --> 00:06:51.390
<i>Matching blows like this is easy enough,
but I'm wasting my time!</i>

00:06:52.300 --> 00:06:54.390
<i>If I don't take their magic...!</i>

00:06:55.180 --> 00:06:57.180
<i>I only have two cartridges left...</i>

00:06:58.430 --> 00:06:59.390
<i>Can I pull it off?</i>

00:07:05.070 --> 00:07:08.070
Arf-san came for me, too...

00:07:08.070 --> 00:07:12.660
Chrono and the others are
supporting us from the Arthra, too.

00:07:21.170 --> 00:07:24.790
Alex, you still haven't been
able to figure out the barrier?

00:07:24.790 --> 00:07:26.920
Just a little longer until we
complete the analysis.

00:07:28.260 --> 00:07:29.920
These equations are all wrong.

00:07:30.420 --> 00:07:33.140
This isn't a Midchildan barrier.

00:07:33.140 --> 00:07:37.180
Yeah... what kind of magic <i>is</i> this?

00:07:40.940 --> 00:07:42.190
You...!

00:07:55.830 --> 00:07:56.700
This is the end for you.

00:07:57.120 --> 00:08:01.210
State your name and home world,
and why you came here.

00:08:05.580 --> 00:08:08.210
Something really bad is coming, Fate!

00:08:13.050 --> 00:08:14.390
Signum!

00:08:20.140 --> 00:08:23.390
Laevatein, Cartridge Load.

00:08:24.440 --> 00:08:25.860
Explosion.

00:08:32.360 --> 00:08:33.860
Sword Flash!

00:08:43.580 --> 00:08:44.620
Defenser.

00:08:50.170 --> 00:08:51.380
Fate!

00:08:53.800 --> 00:08:55.010
You...!

00:09:00.010 --> 00:09:03.270
Fate-chan... Arf-san...

00:09:03.270 --> 00:09:05.390
This is bad...
I have to save them!

00:09:06.060 --> 00:09:09.400
Melodious rhythm, become light!

00:09:12.030 --> 00:09:15.950
Within this field of healing,
grant her defenses of steel.

00:09:20.950 --> 00:09:24.080
This is a healing and protection spell.

00:09:24.080 --> 00:09:26.580
Whatever you do,
don't leave this field, okay?

00:09:26.580 --> 00:09:27.460
Got it.

00:09:36.930 --> 00:09:39.930
What's wrong, Vita?
Did you let your guard down?

00:09:39.930 --> 00:09:43.850
Shut up! I was just about to turn the tables on them!

00:09:43.850 --> 00:09:49.060
I see. I got in your way. My apologies.

00:09:57.490 --> 00:09:59.660
But you shouldn't be too reckless.

00:09:59.660 --> 00:10:03.790
If you got hurt,
our master would worry.

00:10:03.790 --> 00:10:05.830
I know! Geez!

00:10:06.870 --> 00:10:08.670
And you dropped this.

00:10:11.130 --> 00:10:12.960
I repaired the damage.

00:10:13.960 --> 00:10:16.510
Thanks, Signum.

00:10:18.550 --> 00:10:21.350
Right now, the current situation is 3-on-3.

00:10:22.300 --> 00:10:25.350
But in 1-on-1, we Belkan knights...

00:10:25.350 --> 00:10:27.270
...will never lose!

00:10:32.770 --> 00:10:33.520
Huh?

00:10:33.520 --> 00:10:36.530
The Book of Darkness... is gone!

00:10:41.950 --> 00:10:43.160
Are you all right?

00:10:43.160 --> 00:10:46.500
Yeah. Thanks, Yuuno.

00:10:46.500 --> 00:10:48.290
Bardiche has also been...

00:10:50.710 --> 00:10:54.040
It's fine. His main body is still in perfect condition.

00:10:54.040 --> 00:10:55.500
Recovery.

00:11:03.350 --> 00:11:09.770
Yuuno, would you be able to simultaneously
teleport everyone inside this barrier outside?

00:11:09.770 --> 00:11:14.770
Yeah... if I worked together with Arf,
we could probably manage...

00:11:15.440 --> 00:11:17.860
I'll go up in front to fight again.

00:11:17.860 --> 00:11:20.240
While I do that,
could you see if you can do it?

00:11:20.240 --> 00:11:21.030
Alright.

00:11:22.200 --> 00:11:23.280
<i>Arf, is that okay?</i>

00:11:24.030 --> 00:11:27.080
<i>It'll be a bit tricky,
but I'll make it work somehow!</i>

00:11:29.000 --> 00:11:30.460
Well then...

00:11:30.460 --> 00:11:31.750
Let's do our best!

00:11:31.750 --> 00:11:32.370
Yeah!

00:11:56.270 --> 00:11:57.480
Fate-chan...

00:12:26.760 --> 00:12:28.350
Alright.

00:12:31.980 --> 00:12:33.190
Hello?

00:12:33.190 --> 00:12:37.520
Ah, hello? Hayate-chan?
This is Shamal.

00:12:39.150 --> 00:12:40.400
What's up?

00:12:41.570 --> 00:12:42.700
I'm really sorry...

00:12:42.700 --> 00:12:49.830
I couldn't find our usual olive oil, so I'm going
to another supermarket to look for it...

00:12:49.830 --> 00:12:54.830
You don't need to. You really don't
need to push yourself to do that.

00:12:58.920 --> 00:13:02.720
I'll pick up everyone on the way home, so...

00:13:02.720 --> 00:13:03.840
I see.

00:13:04.300 --> 00:13:07.970
Sorry I can't help you cook tonight.

00:13:09.140 --> 00:13:10.350
That's alright.

00:13:11.220 --> 00:13:13.350
I'll hurry home as soon as I can.

00:13:14.140 --> 00:13:15.600
No need to rush.

00:13:15.600 --> 00:13:17.770
Be careful.

00:13:17.770 --> 00:13:19.980
I will. Well then, goodbye.

00:13:22.740 --> 00:13:27.820
That's right... I'll finish this
as soon as I can and go home.

00:13:27.820 --> 00:13:30.830
Klarwind, please guide me.

00:13:30.830 --> 00:13:33.330
Yes. Pendelform.

00:13:51.680 --> 00:13:53.680
Photon Lancer.

00:13:56.850 --> 00:13:59.860
Laevatein, bestow armor upon me.

00:14:00.610 --> 00:14:02.440
Panzergeist!

00:14:07.570 --> 00:14:10.030
Rip through it! Fire!

00:14:22.670 --> 00:14:25.340
You have pretty good senses for a mage...

00:14:26.050 --> 00:14:31.600
but it's not enough to
challenge a Belkan knight!

00:14:43.440 --> 00:14:45.610
Laevatein, cut it in two!

00:14:46.240 --> 00:14:47.360
Roger.

00:14:56.120 --> 00:14:57.830
Fate-chan!

00:15:16.180 --> 00:15:18.270
<i>I've made the preparations to teleport,</i>

00:15:18.270 --> 00:15:21.310
<i>but I can't break through
their spatial barrier! Arf!</i>

00:15:23.940 --> 00:15:28.820
<i>I'm also doing my thing here,
but this barrier is really hard!</i>

00:15:35.740 --> 00:15:36.990
(Reload)
Neu laden.

00:15:37.950 --> 00:15:38.790
<i>That's it...</i>

00:15:39.410 --> 00:15:41.120
<i>Those cartridges...</i>

00:15:41.120 --> 00:15:44.780
<i>They temporarily boost her
magic to incredible levels.</i>

00:15:44.780 --> 00:15:48.760
Is this the end?
Just stay right there, then.

00:15:48.760 --> 00:15:51.510
If you don't resist,
I won't take your life.

00:15:51.510 --> 00:15:52.260
As if!

00:15:54.930 --> 00:15:56.430
I like your spirit.

00:15:57.140 --> 00:16:00.930
(Cloud Knights)
I'm a Belkan knight, one of the Wolkenritter.

00:16:00.930 --> 00:16:01.940
My name is Signum.

00:16:02.900 --> 00:16:05.610
And my blade is Laevatein.

00:16:06.570 --> 00:16:07.730
What's your name?

00:16:09.400 --> 00:16:14.490
Provisional Midchildan mage for the TSAB,

00:16:14.490 --> 00:16:17.450
Fate Testarossa.

00:16:17.450 --> 00:16:19.240
This is Bardiche.

00:16:19.950 --> 00:16:24.000
Testarossa... and Bardiche, huh?

00:16:59.910 --> 00:17:01.040
I have to help them...

00:17:09.750 --> 00:17:13.760
I have to help everyone...

00:17:13.760 --> 00:17:15.430
Master.

00:17:16.180 --> 00:17:19.140
Shooting Mode Acceleration.

00:17:24.390 --> 00:17:26.980
Raising Heart...

00:17:26.980 --> 00:17:30.020
Let's shoot it, Starlight Breaker!

00:17:30.360 --> 00:17:34.150
No way...
that's impossible in your condition!

00:17:34.780 --> 00:17:36.570
I can be shot.

00:17:37.320 --> 00:17:40.160
Using such powerful magic like that now...

00:17:40.160 --> 00:17:42.700
you'll be destroyed, Raising Heart!

00:17:42.700 --> 00:17:44.620
I believe, Master.

00:17:47.500 --> 00:17:50.380
Trust me, my master.

00:17:56.840 --> 00:18:02.140
Raising Heart, if you believe in me...
then I'll believe in you.

00:18:06.440 --> 00:18:09.900
<i>Fate-chan, Yuuno-kun, Arf-san...</i>

00:18:10.560 --> 00:18:15.240
<i>I'll destroy the barrier, so match your
timing with me and teleport everyone!</i>

00:18:16.030 --> 00:18:16.990
<i>Nanoha!</i>

00:18:16.990 --> 00:18:19.910
<i>Nanoha! Will you be all right?</i>

00:18:22.910 --> 00:18:27.910
<i>I'm fine! I'll break through
it with Starlight Breaker!</i>

00:18:28.960 --> 00:18:31.420
Raising Heart, countdown!

00:18:32.340 --> 00:18:33.380
Alright.

00:18:37.510 --> 00:18:39.840
Count IX.

00:18:53.650 --> 00:18:56.360
Raising Heart, are you all right?

00:18:58.070 --> 00:18:59.240
No problem.

00:19:00.360 --> 00:19:02.490
Count III.

00:19:03.280 --> 00:19:04.200
II.

00:19:04.870 --> 00:19:05.830
I.

00:19:10.040 --> 00:19:12.540
Nano... ha?

00:19:34.020 --> 00:19:37.530
Oh no... I missed!

00:19:41.660 --> 00:19:43.410
Nanoha!

00:19:47.120 --> 00:19:49.450
Capture Linker Core.

00:19:51.960 --> 00:19:53.460
Begin collection!

00:19:54.750 --> 00:19:55.920
Collecting.

00:20:23.490 --> 00:20:25.280
Count 0.

00:20:26.370 --> 00:20:29.290
S-Starlight...

00:20:33.670 --> 00:20:35.500
Breaker!

00:20:49.760 --> 00:20:51.930
The barrier's been destroyed!

00:20:51.930 --> 00:20:53.440
Visuals coming in!

00:21:00.780 --> 00:21:04.780
Wh-What is this?!
What's going on down there?!

00:21:04.780 --> 00:21:05.910
This is...!

00:21:07.950 --> 00:21:09.780
Those guys...

00:21:34.060 --> 00:21:36.810
<i>The barrier's been breached!
We have to get out of here!</i>

00:21:37.230 --> 00:21:38.310
<i>I know.</i>

00:21:38.860 --> 00:21:41.230
<i>Sorry about this, Shamal. You saved us.</i>

00:21:41.230 --> 00:21:46.780
<i>Yeah. For now,
let's regroup at the usual place!</i>

00:22:05.050 --> 00:22:08.800
Ah, they're getting away!
Hurry and lock onto them!

00:22:08.800 --> 00:22:10.850
Track their teleportation routes!

00:22:10.850 --> 00:22:12.310
It's not working!

00:22:15.520 --> 00:22:16.560
That's...!

00:22:22.070 --> 00:22:25.570
This is bad. Hurry and send a
medical team immediately.

00:22:25.570 --> 00:22:28.570
Opening central teleportation ports!

00:22:28.570 --> 00:22:32.160
Arrange for medical
treatment in the main office!

00:22:32.160 --> 00:22:33.580
Roger!

00:22:33.580 --> 00:22:36.870
It's no good.
We lost the lock.

00:22:36.870 --> 00:22:38.370
Ah, geez!

00:22:40.710 --> 00:22:45.340
I'm sorry, Chrono-kun... I messed up...

00:22:47.220 --> 00:22:48.720
Chrono-kun?

00:22:49.970 --> 00:22:53.720
The Class 1 lost object
we were searching for...

00:22:53.720 --> 00:22:56.470
The Lost Logia
"The Book of Darkness..."

00:23:00.190 --> 00:23:03.940
Chrono-kun, you know what that thing was?

00:23:03.940 --> 00:23:04.820
Yeah...

00:23:06.690 --> 00:23:08.610
I do...

00:23:08.610 --> 00:23:12.530
I have a less-than-pleasant connection to it...

00:25:08.400 --> 00:25:10.690
The mysterious events
get even more mysterious!

00:25:10.690 --> 00:25:14.400
And it has deep ties to the past...

00:25:14.400 --> 00:25:17.910
But at least Nanoha and Fate
finally have their reunion!

00:25:17.910 --> 00:25:19.700
And it doesn't end there, either!

00:25:19.700 --> 00:25:21.700
Good things can happen, too, huh?

00:25:22.200 --> 00:25:24.960
Next time on
Mahou Shoujo Lyrical Nanoha A's:

00:25:24.960 --> 00:25:29.090
Episode Three:
Reunion and Moving!

00:25:29.090 --> 00:25:31.920
Lyrical Magical, doing our best!
